假设十字链表结点为 OLNode{i,j,e,right,down}，rhead[i] 指向第 i 行，同行结点的列号递增；下标采用 0 起始。逐行沿 right 输出即可。

~~~~c
void PrintTriples(const CrossList *M) {
    int i;
    OLink p;
    if (M == NULL) return;
    for (i = 0; i < M->mu; ++i) {
        for (p = M->rhead[i]; p != NULL; p = p->right) {
            PrintTriple(p->i, p->j, p->e);
        }
    }
}
~~~~

行号外循环递增、行内列号递增，所以输出天然是行优先三元组序列。空行会被跳过，空矩阵不输出任何三元组。时间为 $O(\mu+t)$，额外空间为 $O(1)$。

**独立参考解答（非原书摘录）**

假设十字链表的行链按列递增、列链按行递增，right 与 down 分别为行、列后继。以下采用重建后替换：允许新建结果十字链表 $C$，成功后销毁旧 $A$ 并令 $A=C$；$B$ 保持不变。NewPointerArray 返回全部初始化为 NULL 的指针数组。

~~~~c
void AppendCross(CrossList *C, OLink rtail[], OLink ctail[],
                 int i, int j, ElemType e) {
    OLink s = NewOLNode(i, j, e);
    s->right = s->down = NULL;
    if (rtail[i] != NULL) rtail[i]->right = s;
    else C->rhead[i] = s;
    rtail[i] = s;
    if (ctail[j] != NULL) ctail[j]->down = s;
    else C->chead[j] = s;
    ctail[j] = s;
    ++C->tu;
}

Status AddCross(CrossList *A, const CrossList *B) {
    int i;
    CrossList C;
    OLink *rtail, *ctail, pa, pb;
    if (A->mu != B->mu || A->nu != B->nu) return ERROR;
    InitCross(&C, A->mu, A->nu);
    rtail = NewPointerArray(A->mu);
    ctail = NewPointerArray(A->nu);
    for (i = 0; i < A->mu; ++i) {
        pa = A->rhead[i]; pb = B->rhead[i];
        while (pa != NULL && pb != NULL) {
            if (pa->j < pb->j) {
                AppendCross(&C, rtail, ctail, i, pa->j, pa->e); pa = pa->right;
            } else if (pa->j > pb->j) {
                AppendCross(&C, rtail, ctail, i, pb->j, pb->e); pb = pb->right;
            } else {
                ElemType s = pa->e + pb->e;
                if (s != 0) AppendCross(&C, rtail, ctail, i, pa->j, s);
                pa = pa->right; pb = pb->right;
            }
        }
        while (pa != NULL) { AppendCross(&C, rtail, ctail, i, pa->j, pa->e); pa = pa->right; }
        while (pb != NULL) { AppendCross(&C, rtail, ctail, i, pb->j, pb->e); pb = pb->right; }
    }
    FreePointerArray(rtail); FreePointerArray(ctail);
    DestroyCross(A); *A = C;
    return OK;
}
~~~~

每行作有序归并，同列时仅保留非零的系数和；逐行构造意味着每列的行号也递增，故 ctail 维护的列链正确。空行、空矩阵和相消均被覆盖。假定结点分配成功，时间为 $O(\mu+\nu+t_A+t_B)$，额外空间为 $O(t_C+\mu+\nu)$。

